# AgriScan 3D — frontend environment template.
# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in real values. Every variable is
# optional in development: the app falls back to its built-in defaults.
# NEVER commit real keys — .env / .env.local are gitignored on purpose.
#
# NOTE: there is intentionally NO VITE_API_KEY / VITE_API_URL here. Anything
# prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the public browser bundle — secrets must
# never use that prefix. The backend holds CLASSIFIER_API_KEY server-side.

# FastAPI backend base URL for auth + prediction + history.
#   Development: optional — defaults to http://localhost:8000
#   Production (Vercel): REQUIRED — the build fails loudly without it.
#   Example: https://agriscan-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
